{
  "id": "simulacrum",
  "title": "Simulacrum: AI Campaign Copilot",
  "description": "<p>An AI-powered Campaign Copilot for Foundry Virtual Tabletop that helps Game Masters manage their campaigns through natural language conversation.</p><p><strong>This is the Foundry VTT v12 build</strong>, a community fork of <a href=\"https://github.com/Daxiongmao87/simulacrum-foundry\">Simulacrum</a> by Daxiongmao87 that adds v12 support. v13 and v14 behave exactly as upstream.</p><ul><li>Create, read, update, search and delete documents through chat</li><li>Compendium, asset search, schema introspection, macro and JavaScript tools</li><li>Confirmation and per-tool permissions for destructive operations</li><li>Any OpenAI-compatible endpoint with tool calling (OpenAI, Gemini, OpenRouter, Ollama, LM Studio, ...)</li><li>GM-only access</li></ul><p>See the <a href=\"https://github.com/Aegis-plus/simulacrum-foundry-v12#readme\">README</a> for setup and model recommendations.</p>",
  "authors": [
    {
      "name": "Daxiongmao87",
      "url": "https://github.com/Daxiongmao87"
    },
    {
      "name": "Aegis-plus",
      "url": "https://github.com/Aegis-plus"
    }
  ],
  "version": "1.1.0",
  "compatibility": {
    "minimum": "12",
    "verified": "14"
  },
